{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"valid\": true,\n  \"entry\": \"左上方第一块大字号、亮度最高的文字，先看到“明知道回去未必找得回那份亲近”，视线随后落到“万一能呢？”。\",\n  \"grasp_who\": \"一个明知回去未必能找回从前的亲近，却仍忍不住期待重新获得那份亲近的人。\",\n  \"grasp_feel\": \"留恋、期待、犹豫，带着不确定。\",\n  \"missed\": \"他并不打算立刻回去，而是想先把眼下的日子过稳；他仍害怕以后独自承担事情，但又不想因为害怕而收回已经做出的打算。\",\n  \"burden\": [\n    \"两块同样显眼的大字号文字争夺主视线，第一块表达留恋和期待，第二块展开现实顾虑与行动打算。\",\n    \"第二块文字较长，一块里包含先稳定当下、担心未来独自承担、不愿撤回打算等好几层意思。\"\n  ],\n  \"score\": 3\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "97d4e06d-b4a1-4132-8383-6bbb3e3ffa9d", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261110T013920701367Z", "elapsed_seconds": 25.641, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T01:39:46.349094+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "4cdc628233359b9bf49860c93ec47d90815b26b9ded6a84402520068f70dd2b8", "attachment_count": 1}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 1, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachme